    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A cozy horror game where you own and manage a burger shop.<br><br><strong>Prepare burger.\u00a0</strong> <br> <br><strong>Serve customers. </strong> <br> <br><strong>Survive midnight nightmare.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Late Shift - Midnight Burger is a psychological horror games inspired by The Boba Teashop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is available in English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese and Indonesian.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~60 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Burger Tower\u3011 <br>\u00a0 Create custom burgers of different types. You can even make burgers as high as the roof.<br><br>\u3010Mini Games\u3011 <br>\u00a0 You can play darts while waiting for customers to arrive. <br><br>\u3010Jumpscare\u3011 <br>\u00a0 Beware of jumpscares that can appear suddenly.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A cozy horror game where you own and manage a burger shop.<br><br><strong>Prepare burger.\u00a0</strong> <br> <br><strong>Serve customers. </strong> <br> <br><strong>Survive midnight nightmare.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Late Shift - Midnight Burger is a psychological horror games inspired by The Boba Teashop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is available in English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese and Indonesian.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~60 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Burger Tower\u3011 <br>\u00a0 Create custom burgers of different types. You can even make burgers as high as the roof.<br><br>\u3010Mini Games\u3011 <br>\u00a0 You can play darts while waiting for customers to arrive. <br><br>\u3010Jumpscare\u3011 <br>\u00a0 Beware of jumpscares that can appear suddenly.</p>",
